---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Paul Digital"
  description="Contact Paul Digital for app support, bug reports, feature feedback, privacy and legal questions, or general inquiries."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h1>Get in touch</h1>
      <p>For support and inquiries, contact Paul Digital by email.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Contact <a href="mailto:askpaulonline@gmail.com">askpaulonline@gmail.com</a> for app
        support, bug reports, feature feedback, privacy questions, legal or Terms questions, and
        business or general inquiries.
      </p>
      <h2>App support</h2>
      <p>
        To help us understand an app issue, include the app name, device model, Android version,
        a description of the problem, and the steps needed to reproduce it, if applicable.
      </p>
      <h2>Website tools and guides</h2>
      <p>
        If a web tool gives an unexpected result, tell us the tool's address, the browser and device you used, and the type and
        approximate size of the file. Please do not attach private documents; a similar test file is enough. If you find a
        mistake or something out of date in a <a href="/guides/">guide</a>, include the guide's title and what should change.
      </p>
      <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about the information described in the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, email the same address
        with "Privacy" in the subject line.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a> ·
        <a href="/apps/">Paul Digital apps</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
